('3.10.3.3.1.3-LAYERS', 'GCL', 'ASPIRATION', '{ASPIRATION}', '3.10', 'Category 1 ingredients in any distinct layer', 'Category 1 (entire mixture)', 'all', '>=', 10, null, '%', null, 20.5, 'mm2/s at 40 °C (kinematic viscosity, ≤)', 'Sum of Category 1 ingredients in any distinct layer', 'In the case of a mixture which separates into two or more distinct layers, the entire mixture is classified as Category 1 if in any distinct layer the sum of the concentrations of Category 1 ingredients is ≥ 10 %, and it has a kinematic viscosity ≤ 20,5 mm2/s, measured at 40 °C.', '3.10.3.3.1.3', '3.10.3.3.1', 'M19', null, false),
