('4.1.3.1-RELEVANT-A1C1', 'RELEVANT', 'AQUATIC', '{AQUATIC_ACUTE,AQUATIC_CHRONIC}', '4.1', '‘Acute 1’ or ‘Chronic 1’', null, 'all', '>=', 0.1, null, '% w/w', null, null, null, null, 'The ‘relevant components’ of a mixture are those which are classified ‘Acute 1’or ‘Chronic 1’ and present in a concentration of 0,1 % (w/w) or greater, and those which are classified ‘Chronic 2’, ‘Chronic 3’ or ‘Chronic 4’ and present in a concentration of 1 % (w/w) or greater, unless there is a presumption (such as in the case of highly toxic components (see section 4.1.3.5.5.5)) that a component present in a lower concentration can still be relevant for classifying the mixture for aquatic environmental hazards.', '4.1.3.1', '4.1.3.1', 'M2', 'Это ссылка сноски (4) Table 1.1.', false),
